[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730228098","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123606#issuecomment-5730228098","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123606","id":5730228098,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVYxXgg","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T12:49:57Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T12:50:52Z","body":"Seems there might be some bug in the detection code, but if the ICU data is actually used this is intended\n\nWhat languages is the project using? What is the `internationalization/locale/fallback` setting? An MRP might be necessary here\n\nCC @bruvzg \n\n(Marking this as a regression as the change was merged in 4.7 and present in 4.6 as it was cherry-picked)","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730228098/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730324780","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123606#issuecomment-5730324780","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123606","id":5730324780,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVY3RLA","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T12:58:43Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T12:59:53Z","body":"I added a \"sneaky\" link to the project in the issue. But the translation files are at https://github.com/MewPurPur/GodSVG/tree/main/translations\n\nI could help with MRP later, I need to get back to work now.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730324780/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730388211","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123606#issuecomment-5730388211","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123606","id":5730388211,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVY7I8w","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T13:03:59Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T13:26:02Z","body":"In this case the data should be there, you have translations for languages that require ICU data, see:\nhttps://github.com/godotengine/godot/blob/9c776068d6ed23acd0c78bfe534272d1d2a3a619/modules/text_server_adv/text_server_adv.cpp#L508-L515\n\nSo I don't think there's a bug here, but things working as expected, if you are using these languages this data is needed AFAIK\n\nIt being included automatically should probably be documented though, for example [here](https://docs.godotengine.org/en/stable/tutorials/i18n/internationalizing_games.html#adding-break-iterator-data-to-exported-project), or we could add an opt-in option to disable it even if needed, with a warning for it\n\nIt might also long-term be possible to have more fine-grained checks to validate if the data should be present or not, but this data being missing has been a major source of confusion and frustration, e.g.:\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/110109\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/117102\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/86113\n* https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/108864\n\nAnd many more\n\nWe could replace the automatic inclusion with a warning but that'd be breaking compatibility I'd say as a lot of projects probably rely on it now and people are oblivious to this being necessary in the first place, and might ignore such a warning but still hurting the end results of their games by not understanding the necessity. So I'd say that the most viable option would be to have an opt-in explicit opt-out setting with a warning saying that the exported project has translations for a language that needs these rules and that it might break UI behavior for these languages","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730388211/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730730679","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123606#issuecomment-5730730679","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123606","id":5730730679,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVZQCtw","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T13:32:16Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T13:34:20Z","body":"Hum, I see, that's quite tricky. I hope I'll hear from bruzvg about it. I'm curious if the Chinese text breaky thingies are really a whole 4.8 MB, or it's more of a problem from adding a monolithic file instead of being smart about generating a subset, and if so, if it's possible to alleviate this burden from projects by building a subset, and again if so, if there are any plans.\n\nIn any case, since this fixes some bugs, I guess it's more acceptable to tank the massive increase in the PCK's size.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730730679/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730761645","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123606#issuecomment-5730761645","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123606","id":5730761645,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABVZR7rQ","user":{"login":"AThousandShips","id":96648715,"node_id":"U_kgDOBcK-Cw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/96648715?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips","html_url":"https://github.com/AThousandShips","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/AThousandShips/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-18T13:34:46Z","updated_at":"2026-09-18T13:49:16Z","body":"It might be possible to break it up, not sure how much is taken up by each specific language, I suspect Chinese might be a big portion of it and that a lot of it overlaps with Japanese though, as well as between variants of Chinese\n\nFor anyone interested in how the raw data file is generated, see [this](https://github.com/unicode-org/icu/blob/main/docs/userguide/icu_data/buildtool.md)\n\nThe data contains a lot of other things that might be opt-in as well, like confusable symbols etc., that are relevant and helpful for various contexts, so we could go more fine-grained there as well, but that might be complicated to ensure it works in a compatible way","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5730761645/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5836732936","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123606#issuecomment-5836732936","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123606","id":5836732936,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABW-V6CA","user":{"login":"bruvzg","id":7645683,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjc2NDU2ODM=","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/7645683?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg","html_url":"https://github.com/bruvzg","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/bruvzg/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-25T17:35:39Z","updated_at":"2026-09-25T17:35:39Z","body":"> I'm curious if the Chinese text breaky thingies are really a whole 4.8 MB, or it's more of a problem from adding a monolithic file instead of being smart about generating a subset\n\nIt's not, 4.8 MB is break rules for all supported languages and some other data. 15 KB of it should be actually always included, since it's used for complex emoji handling (see https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/120232).\n\nIt is a fixed subset of full ICU data (about 33.5 MB) made manually when updating ICU library, while it should be possible to extract specific smaller subset for used languages on export, not sure if it's worth doing for 4.8 MB. I do not think there's code for subsetting it in the ICU itself, or data format is fully documented and won't change in future versions.","author_association":"MEMBER","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5836732936/reactions","total_count":2,"+1":2,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5843292238","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/issues/123606#issuecomment-5843292238","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/123606","id":5843292238,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc8AAAABXEmQTg","user":{"login":"MewPurPur","id":85438892,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjg1NDM4ODky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/85438892?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur","html_url":"https://github.com/MewPurPur","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/MewPurPur/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2026-09-26T04:48:50Z","updated_at":"2026-09-26T06:51:07Z","body":"I'm just wondering here, since players can write Chinese in a line-wrapped TextEdit or other places, or you might have some Chinese text in a game even if the game itself isn't localized to Chinese, then doesn't this mean Godot should always include the ICU data to avoid bugs, i.e. it should've always been opt-out instead of opt-in?","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","pin":null,"reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/5843292238/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null}]